cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >
  If you use this software in your research, please cite it using the metadata below.
title: "Amazonas-Kipppunkt: interactive double-well sandbox for amazon-utac (P19)"
abstract: >
  Interactive companion to GenesisAeon Package 19 (amazon-utac). Ports the cubic
  double-well ODE of the Amazon forest–savanna transition and keeps the legacy
  1 %/yr model rate separate from the observed INPE PRODES 2024/2025 rate of
  0.16 %/yr (consolidated). Calibrated against Lovejoy & Nobre (2019) and Boulton et al. (2022).
version: "0.3.1"
date-released: "2026-09-04"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/GenesisAeon/amazon-kipppunkt"
